Summary used to set WEB_SEARCH_RESULT_COUNT=5 and to turn
BYPASS_WEB_SEARCH_WEB_LOADER off (docker-compose.yml / deploy-demo-box.yml
carry the full reasoning): search-only latency stayed 0.27-0.69s across all
runs; adding concurrent full-page fetch of 5 results added roughly 0.5-2s on
top, dominated by the single slowest page rather than growing linearly with
result count, because fetches run concurrently. Total end-to-end latency
stayed under ~2.1s in every sample here.

